 passé)"}],"droite":[{"id":"d0","texte":"I would like to go"},{"id":"d1","texte":"I wish I hadn’t said that"},{"id":"d2","texte":"I regret saying that"},{"id":"d3","texte":"I wish I had more time"}]},{"enonce":"Remets en ordre le regret « Si seulement j’avais écouté ! ». La phrase commence par If.","aide":"*If only* se construit comme *wish*.","type":"ordre","items":[{"id":"a","texte":"listened"},{"id":"b","texte":"I"},{"id":"c","texte":"had"},{"id":"d","texte":"only"},{"id":"e","texte":"If"}]}]}$ex$::jsonb,
